4.3 Selection of Translations
When using two words co-occurrence tendency, the terms actually used for the query in target language are determined as follows:
1. Obtain the number of retrieved documents for each term in the query from the Web search engine,
2. Obtain numbers of retrieved documents for all possible combinations of each pair of translationcandidates, whose occurrence frequency for each term exceed the threshold value Tfreq,from the Web search engine (using an AND operator),
3. Calculate the average of COTs for all possible combinations of the translation-candidate pairs,
4. The term sets whose COT exceed the threshold value Tcor are selected as the target language query.
